<!-- Challenges and Customization -->
<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div><img src="~/assets/img/dynamics365/Developer2.webp" class="img-fluid text-start ms-0 mb-5 me-3 p-3" alt="Student Management" /></div>
                <div><img src="~/assets/img/dynamics365/woman-tech-desk-chart-bureau.webp" class="img-fluid text-start ms-0 mb-5 mt-3 me-3 p-3" alt="Student Management" /></div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-8 Imgborder" align="justify">
                <h3><b>Common Student Management Challenges and How to Address Them</b></h3>
                <p>Educational institutions can face disconnected student information, manual processes, limited visibility, inconsistent communication and complex student management activities.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Disconnected Student Information:</b> Connect student profiles, academic, attendance, examination, learning and fee information through integrated workflows.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Manual Student Administration:</b> Automate repetitive data entry, approvals, notifications, updates and routine student-related activities.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Limited Student Visibility:</b> Use centralized dashboards and reports to provide timely information to administrators, educators and academic teams.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Complex Student Journeys:</b> Create consistent digital experiences across registration, academics, attendance, examinations, student services and communication.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Student Data Management Concerns:</b> Use structured access controls, secure integrations and appropriate data-management practices.</p></li>
                </ul><br />

                <h3><b>The Importance of Customization in Student Management</b></h3>
                <p>Every educational institution has different student structures, academic policies, departments, users and processes. Customization helps the solution fit the institution's student management model.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Customize Student Workflows:</b> Configure student management processes around the institution's actual policies, departments and operating model.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Create Role-Based Experiences:</b> Provide relevant information and actions to students, administrators, educators, staff and other users.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Automate Student Notifications:</b> Configure alerts, reminders, approvals and workflow notifications for important student and academic events.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Build Custom Dashboards:</b> Provide role-specific reporting and visibility into student information, academic performance and attendance.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Use Student Feedback:</b> Continuously improve the solution based on real-world student usage, feedback and institutional outcomes.</p></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

