<!-- Change Management and ROI -->
<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-8" align="justify">
                <h3><b>Managing Change for Successful Student Management Adoption</b></h3>
                <p>Successful student management transformation depends on user adoption, clear communication, training and continuous improvement.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Communicate the Vision:</b> Explain how the student management solution improves student experiences, operational efficiency and visibility.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Engage Stakeholders:</b> Involve students, administrators, educators, academic departments, IT teams and other relevant stakeholders.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Provide Role-Based Training:</b> Train users on workflows, features and responsibilities relevant to their roles.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Roll Out in Phases:</b> Introduce capabilities progressively, validate results and address issues before wider adoption.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Provide Ongoing Support:</b> Review usage, resolve questions and continuously optimize the student management solution.</p></li>
                </ul><br />

                <h3><b>How to Optimize Student Management for Maximum ROI</b></h3>
                <p>Continuous measurement and optimization help institutions improve student experience, operational efficiency and measurable value.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Define KPIs:</b> Measure adoption, administrative efficiency, student experience, process performance and institutional outcomes.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Integrate Core Platforms:</b> Connect the solution with learning, academic, examination, fee and other relevant applications.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Improve User Experience:</b> Simplify student and staff journeys to reduce friction and improve productivity.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Review Performance:</b> Regularly assess workflows, adoption, data quality and student management results.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Leverage Automation and Analytics:</b> Use automation and reporting to reduce manual effort and support better student-management decisions.</p></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 Imgborder">
                <div><img src="~/assets/img/dynamics365/Developer2.webp" class="img-fluid text-start ms-0 mb-5 mt-3 me-3 p-3" alt="Student Management" /></div>
                <div><img src="~/assets/img/dynamics365/woman-tech-desk-chart-bureau.webp" class="img-fluid text-start ms-0 mb-5 mt-3 me-3 p-3" alt="Student Management" /></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

